    "detailed_description": "Your life is a true success story - you have achieved your dreams, become rich, and got everything you've ever wanted. There is nothing that you can't buy now. But why can't you feel happy? Is this what you wanted?..<br />\r\nEverything changes when your personal plane crashes into the ocean, and you find yourself on an unknown island, which completely changes your life in the next few days.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;My Furry Dictator&quot; is a short visual novel about love, success, goals, and happiness. Our heroes are very different but feel the same emotions, have the same thoughts. Maybe political views don't matter so much; maybe this is a chance for them to find their love? Find it out yourself in &quot;My Furry Dictator&quot;!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Fascinating story with romance and comedy elements. <br />\r\n\u2022 HD fully original artworks.<br />\r\n\u2022 2 hours of content.<br />\r\n\u2022 Relaxing atmosphere. <br />\r\n\u2022 Hot dictator!",
